        "Title": "Watchdogs moment",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_NIGHT",
        "PublicId": "104241414178",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_mamba.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 69be3679-a4a0-4466-aff4-a44888465637).Image",
        "Description": "Marcus and SD are on a Dog Watching vacation, killing time while doing so. That is, in fact why they call them Dedsec.  We cannot let that precious time be wasted by such foolish actions! Originally, the plan was to send Neo straight from the matrix to carry out the action, but the only problem we met  was, well, the poor thing just escaped the matrix so he&apos;s currently struggling to blink, now he&apos;s on the sunroof photosynthetisating. Please, put him out of his misery.  I just cant watch. (dogs)",
